| Edge Case         | Example                         | Expected Result                                     |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| Empty expression  | `""`                            | Program should handle it safely                     |
| Unknown variable  | `x y +` where `y` is not stored | Program should show variable not found              |
| Division by zero  | `5 0 /`                         | Program should throw or show division by zero error |
| Malformed token   | `5 2 @`                         | Program should reject invalid token                 |
| Missing operands  | `5 +`                           | Program should handle stack error                   |
| Normal expression | `2 3 +`                         | Result should be `5`                                |
